This modern marvel changed the world by efficiently eliminating the waste most people don't want to think about.

49
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:07,380
At American Standard, located in the aptly named Piscataway, New Jersey,

50
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:13,680
