100
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:03,820
The rest is fluid dynamics and good old gravity.

101
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:06,520
You can see on the screen, it's

102
00:07:06,521 --> 00:07:08,280
is the flow-wise bowl.

103
00:07:08,281 --> 00:07:10,980
If the shape comes out wrong, we lose the performance.

104
00:07:10,981 --> 00:07:14,400
It's actually a very small margin of error.

105
00:07:14,401 --> 00:07:17,540
With a cutaway, we can see all the components together

106
00:07:17,541 --> 00:07:19,220
that give us maximum performance.

107
00:07:21,060 --> 00:07:22,560
American standards engineers

